<title>GERMANY: Metro says wants to raise approved capital.</title>
<headline>Metro says wants to raise approved capital.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retail group Metro AG said  on Friday that it wants to increase approved capital by up to 350  million marks.</p>
<p>Metro made the announcement in an advertisement in the Boerse-Zeitung  newspaper, inviting shareholders to an extraordinary shareholder meeting  on September 11.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 260 97150</p>
